---
interface Props {
  updated: Date;
}

const { updated } = Astro.props;
const updatedLabel = updated.toLocaleDateString("zh-TW", {
  year: "numeric",
  month: "2-digit",
  day: "2-digit",
});
---

<section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-introduction-title">
  <div class="about-hero__copy">
    <span class="about-hero__eyebrow">
      <i class="i-ri-terminal-box-line" aria-hidden="true" />
      HELLO, WORLD :D
    </span>
    <h2 id="about-introduction-title">我是 Flashingtw，<br /><em>還在慢慢變強的人。</em></h2>
    <p>
      大安高工電子科學生，也是大安電研社社長。現在主要用 C++
      寫競程、學演算法，偶爾把腦中很怪的生成想法做成 Minecraft 插件。
    </p>
    <p>
      這裡放的是我真的做過、撞過牆、debug 過的東西。技術還在補，當然不會假裝自己什麼都會
      <del>會的話就不會一直 WA 了</del> uwu
    </p>

    <div class="about-hero__actions">
      <a href="https://github.com/Flashingtw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <i class="i-ri-github-fill" aria-hidden="true" />
        GitHub
      </a>
      <a href="#about-timeline" class="about-hero__secondary-action">
        <i class="i-ri-time-line" aria-hidden="true" />
        看時間線
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="about-hero__updated">
      最後更新 <time datetime={updated.toISOString()}>{updatedLabel}</time>
    </p>
  </div>

  <aside class="about-status" aria-label="目前狀態">
    <div class="about-status__topline">
      <span class="about-status__pulse" aria-hidden="true" />
      NOW BUILDING
    </div>
    <strong>下一個更好的自己</strong>
    <p>從第一次 APCS 實作 0 分開始，現在還在競賽、專案和社團之間繼續疊經驗值。</p>

    <dl>
      <div>
        <dt>MAIN</dt>
        <dd>C++ / 演算法</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>LEVEL</dt>
        <dd>APCS 實作 4 級</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>ROLE</dt>
        <dd>大安電研社社長</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>SINCE</dt>
        <dd>2025.08</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </aside>
</section>

<section class="about-focus" aria-labelledby="about-focus-title">
  <header class="about-heading">
    <span>01</span>
    <div>
      <h2 id="about-focus-title">現在的主線任務</h2>
      <p>先把正在做的事做好，技能樹之後再慢慢點 ww</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <ul class="about-focus__list">
    <li>
      <i class="i-ri-code-box-line" aria-hidden="true" />
      <div><strong>競技程式設計</strong><span>持續練演算法、資料結構與正式賽事的臨場能力。</span></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <i class="i-ri-group-line" aria-hidden="true" />
      <div><strong>社團與交流</strong><span>帶領大安電研社，一起寫題、做東西和交流技術。</span></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <i class="i-ri-hammer-line" aria-hidden="true" />
      <div><strong>把想法做出來</strong><span>用 Java 做 Minecraft 生成插件，順便跟效能問題互毆。</span></div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(17rem, 0.75fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color-muted);
    border-radius: 1.4rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 8% 8%, var(--cb-focus-bg), transparent 34%),
      var(--box-bg-shadow);
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-soft);
  }

  .about-hero::after {
    position: absolute;
    right: -3rem;
    bottom: -5rem;
    width: 15rem;
    height: 15rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-blue) 22%, transparent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    content: "";
  }

  .about-hero__copy,
  .about-status {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .about-hero__eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: 0.73rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .about-hero h2 {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.8vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .about-hero h2 em {
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .about-hero__copy > p:not(.about-hero__updated) {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0.55rem 0;
    color: var(--text-color-muted);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .about-hero__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 1.3rem;
  }

  .about-hero__actions a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-blue);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--color-blue);
    padding: 0.62rem 0.95rem;
    color: var(--grey-0);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 160ms ease;
  }

  .about-hero__actions a:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .about-hero__actions .about-hero__secondary-action {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }

  .about-hero__updated {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--text-color-subtle);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .about-status {
    align-self: center;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-blue) 24%, var(--border-color-muted));
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--box-bg-shadow) 88%, transparent);
    padding: 1.15rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .about-status__topline {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--color-green);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .about-status__pulse {
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-green);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.25rem color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-green) 15%, transparent);
  }

  .about-status > strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .about-status > p {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text-color-muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .about-status dl {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-status dl > div {
    border-radius: 0.65rem;
    background: var(--line-hover-bg);
    padding: 0.65rem;
  }

  .about-status dt,
  .about-status dd {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-status dt {
    color: var(--text-color-subtle);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .about-status dd {
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
    color: var(--text-color);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .about-focus {
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  .about-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-heading > span {
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .about-heading h2,
  .about-heading p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-heading h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-heading p {
    margin-top: 0.18rem;
    color: var(--text-color-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .about-focus__list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .about-focus__list > li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color-muted);
    border-radius: 0.9rem;
    background: var(--box-bg-shadow);
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .about-focus__list > li::before {
    display: none;
    content: none;
  }

  .about-focus__list i {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-focus__list strong,
  .about-focus__list span {
    display: block;
  }

  .about-focus__list strong {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  .about-focus__list span {
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
    color: var(--text-color-muted);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .about-hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-focus__list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .about-status dl {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-hero__actions a {
      justify-content: center;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .about-hero__actions a {
      transition: none;
    }

    .about-hero__actions a:hover {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
